 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (7)': Hidden Base / Systems Will Slip Through Your Fingers, Clak'dor VII (the Hidden Base indicator system), Rendezvous Point, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Insurrection, Staging Areas, Squadron Assignments; these count toward the 60 (total 60).",
  "The post was tagged Dark by mistake; the poster says it is a Light Side deck.",
  "Credited by real name only (byline handle not used).",
  "Posted 'Clak'dor IIV(indicator)' dested Clak'dor VII; 'Revivy Kenobi' dested Ben Kenobi (the Special Edition Ben who 'revives' a forfeited character); 'Chewy with Armor' dested Chewbacca, Protector (the only Chewbacca of the era with an armor value, deploys with Leia); 'Dash' dested Dash Rendar (listed under People).",
  "Posted 'Red Squadron Uno' dested Red Squadron 1 (strategy says 'red 1'); 'Yodas Home' dested Dagobah: Yoda's Hut (strategy says 'Dagobah Yoda's Hut'); 'Qui-Gon's Saber' dested the Tatooine-set Qui-Gon Jinn's Lightsaber; 'Weapon Lev' dested the Light Jabba's Palace Weapon Levitation; 'Dagobah' and 'Tatooine' dested the Light Dagobah and Premiere systems.",
  "The 'Places (7)' header lists six locations; Clak'dor VII is in the starting group."
